		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant yellowjacket wasp with a spider's eight eyes, mandibles, and two long foreleg pincers. Prefers spiders but will eat any flesh.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 12, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 rend +2 (1d6) or implant, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Freedom</strong>. Cannot be caught in or immobilized by webs.</p><p></p><p><strong>Implant</strong>. Lay egg inside helpless mortal. CON 15+ or paralyzed. Repeat check once per day; ends on success. After 2d6 days, egg hatches, killing host and spawning a spider eater.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
